mmitter":{"date":"2025-11-15T14:17:41Z","email":"dev.tdlv@gmail.com","name":"ravenn-studios"},"message":"Add landing page and refactor navigation with centralized header component\n\nThis commit adds a professional landing page and improves the navigation system with a centralized header component:\n\nStyling Enhancements\n- Navigation redesign: Implemented pill-style active states for navigation links with hover effects\n- User dropdown menu: Moved Settings and Logout into a user dropdown menu for cleaner header\n- Consistent header: Created centralized header component used across all pages for consistent styling\n- Landing page: Added professional homepage with hero section, features showcase, and tech stack display\n\nLayout Improvements\n- Header component: Extracted header into reusable Blade component (resources/views/components/header.blade.php)\n- Root route logic: Updated root route to show landing page for unauthenticated users, dashboard for authenticated users\n- Navigation behavior: Logo links to homepage when logged out, dashboard when logged in\n- Responsive design: Landing page is fully responsive with mobile-friendly layouts\n\nDocumentation Updates\n- README updates: Updated documentation to reflect modern UI design (removed dark theme references)\n- Settings navigation: Updated instructions to reflect new dropdown menu location\n- Project structure: Added components directory and welcome page to project structure documentation\n- Feature additions: Documented landing page and modern UI as new features\n\nThese changes provide a more professional first impression with the landing page while maintaining consistent navigation across all pages through the centralized header component.","tree":{"sha":"76b22567e3a4231ca3cb7ec08b7c40e7d087790c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/git/trees/76b22567e3a4231ca3cb7ec08b7c40e7d087790c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/git/commits/d42678bcf63f20ab2f559e1