orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/commits/52b5f3275e4b01c74693e0e630d513e91e69507b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T23:56:41Z","email":"dev.tdlv@gmail.com","name":"ravenn-studios"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T23:56:41Z","email":"dev.tdlv@gmail.com","name":"ravenn-studios"},"message":"Complete invoicing platform with multi-currency support, PDF templates, file attachments, and automated reminders\n\nMulti-Currency Support\n- Full currency support with 10+ currencies (USD, EUR, GBP, JPY, AUD, CAD, CHF, CNY, INR, NZD)\n- Currency selection on invoice and quote creation forms\n- Automatic currency symbol derivation from currency codes\n- Currency-aware formatting across all views, PDFs, and emails\n- Database migration adds currency_code, currency_symbol, and currency_rate columns\n\nPDF Templates\n- Multiple PDF template options (classic and modern)\n- Template selection on invoice/quote creation\n- Professional modern template with enhanced styling\n- Template support in PDF generation service\n\nFile Attachments\n- Upload multiple attachments per invoice\n- File management with download functionality\n- Secure file storage in Laravel storage\n- Attachment display on invoice detail pages\n- Database migration for invoice_attachments table\n\nAutomated Invoice Reminders\n- Scheduled command to send payment reminders\n- Email template for overdue and due-soon invoices\n- Configurable reminder timing\n- Integration with Laravel task scheduler\n\nEnhanced Models and Services\n- Currency symbol accessors with fallback logic\n- Improved invoice and quote services with currency handling\n- Base controller with authorization traits\n- Enhanced database seeder with currency examples\n\nUI Improvements\n- Currency display throughout all views\n- Attachment sections on invoice pages\n- Currency selectors in create/edit forms\n- Updated dashboard with currency-aware formatting\n- Enhanced client portal with currency support\n\nThese changes provide international billing capabilities, professional document generation, file management, and automated client communication while maintaining backward compatibility with existing invoices.","tree":{"sha":"2d49b3d4041e9a1972bbff65ed71176f9414f2bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/git/trees/2d49b3d4041e9a1972bbff65ed71176f9414f2bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/git/commits/52b5f3275e4b01c74693e0e630d513e91e69507b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212231781?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devtdlv","id":212231781,"login":"devtdlv","node_id":"U_kgDODKZmZQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/commit/52b5f3275e4b01c74693e0e630d513e91e69507b","node_id":"C_kwDOQVZ7hNoAKDUyYjVmMzI3NWU0YjAxYzc0NjkzZTBlNjMwZDUxM2U5MWU2OTUwN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/commit/3e4b1c92b9f7b69013b84169d643558b8fb7bab1","sha":"3e4b1c92b9f7b69013b84169d643558b8fb7bab1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/commits/3e4b1c92b9f7b69013b84169d643558b8fb7bab1"}],"sha":"52b5f3275e4b01c74693e0e630d513e91e69507b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/commits/52b5f3275e4b01c74693e0e630d513e91e69507b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212231781?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devtdlv","id":212231781,"login":"devtdlv","node_id":"U_kgDODKZmZQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/commits/3e4b1c92b9f7b69013b84169d643558b8fb7bab1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T14:49:17Z","email":"dev.tdlv@gmail.com","name":"ravenn-studios"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T14:49:17Z","email":"dev.tdlv@gmail.com","name":"ravenn-studios"},"message":"Expanded invoicing platform with analytics, automation, email notifications, and a bright default theme\n\nAnalytics Enhancements\n- Dashboard metrics: revenue KPIs, recent activity, overdue alerts, and top clients.\n- Reports: revenue trends and client performance with date filters and CSV export.\n- Advanced search/filtering: query invoices by status, client, date range, and sort dynamically.\n\nCommunication and Automation\n- Email notifications: branded invoice emails with direct client-portal links.\n- Bulk actions: select multiple invoices to mark as sent or paid, or delete.\n- Scheduled tasks: artisan command automatically updates overdue invoices.\n\nBilling and Data\n- Recurring invoice foundation: schemas and models ready for automated billing.\n- CSV export: one-click download of invoice data for accounting systems.\n\nUI and UX\n- Modern light theme with accent highlights.\n- Active navigation states for clear page context.","tree":{"sha":"9a3f1deffc97c886ccdf3b47af0d19362b91230a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/git/trees/9a3f1deffc97c886ccdf3b47af0d19362b91230a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devtdlv/baphomet-invoicer/git/commits/3e4b1c92b9f7b69013b84169d643558b8fb7bab1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212231781?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devtdlv","id":212231781,"login":"devtdlv","node_id":"U_kgDODKZmZQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtdlv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"