70cc417ca9cc36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T21:08:51Z","email":"tmacey@boundlessnotions.com","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T21:08:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: prevent generatePath error when author is invalid in AuthorLabel (#821)\n\nWrap learnerPostsLink creation in useMemo with guard to prevent\n''Missing :learnerUsername param'' error. The generatePath function\nwas being called unconditionally during render even when the link\nwouldn''t be displayed, causing errors when author was null, undefined,\nor the ''anonymous'' string.\n\nThe fix ensures generatePath is only called when showUserNameAsLink\nis true, which validates that author is a valid username.","tree":{"sha":"a4ba51c40b5b7bd816b9594e7a329864b6e473a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manhkhang0812/frontend-app-discussions/git/trees/a4ba51c40b5b7bd816b9594e7a329864b6e473a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manhkhang0812/frontend-app-discussions/git/commits/a4826ae62de72613c587b83f6a70cc417ca9cc36","verification":{"payload":"tree a4ba51c40b5b7bd816b9594e7a329864b6e473a2\nparent 16c49b2404c78210a74ff6511da7ec78ae16b88c\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@boundlessnotions.com> 1763068131 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763068131 -0500\n\nfix: prevent generatePath error when author is invalid in AuthorLabel (#821)\n\nWrap learnerPostsLink creation in useMemo with guard to prevent\n''Missing :learnerUsername param'' error. The generatePath function\nwas being called unconditionally during render even when the link\nwouldn''t be displayed, causing errors when author was null, undefined,\nor the ''anonymous'' string.\n\nThe fix ensures generatePath is only called when showUserNameAsLink\nis true, which validates that author is a valid username.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpFkjjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUq4QAILL7fhmLUqC9SxmJV99VMIZ\n9o/eC+U0ULfeTdXNI0Z6c9xDtZ