e":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(browser-app): never reach for localhost in production bundles\n\nframe.jim.software mounts the cv-builder Settings remote on every page\nload, and its connection probe fetched http://localhost:3001/health\nbecause VITE_API_URL is unset on Vercel and the fallback was loopback.\nChrome then showed every visitor a Local Network Access prompt.\n\n- config/api.ts: localhost defaults only under import.meta.env.DEV;\n  empty means \"no API configured\". Adds getApiV2BaseUrl().\n- client, client-v2, bioFilesApi: resolve through config and throw\n  \"API not configured\" instead of fetching when the base is empty.\n- SettingsPanel: new ''not-configured'' status; skips the probe.\n- App.tsx: dev-only localhost app switcher navigation.\n- artifact-scanner: new loopback-url violation for browser-app dist,\n  so a regression fails `pnpm build` (postbuild) in CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23e2f92c6c99b3f1da51ce1386d7023bde2373d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/23e2f92c6c99b3f1da51ce1386d7023bde2373d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/e5cecf370a9e5ac3d44583532e4b3274aad61d57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/e5cecf370a9e5ac3d44583532e4b3274aad61d57","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKGU1Y2VjZjM3MGE5ZTVhYzNkNDQ1ODM1MzJlNGIzMjc0YWFkNjFkNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/1f48bdab863e8ac298951387743d3a98f51e1134","sha":"1f48bdab863e8ac298951387743d3a98f51e1134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/1f48bdab863e8ac298951387743d3a98f51e1134"}],"sha":"e5cecf370a9e5ac3d44583532e4b3274aad61d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/e5cecf370a9e5ac3d44583532e4b3274aad61d57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/1f48bdab863e8ac298951387743d3a98f51e1134/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:43:26Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:22:23Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: reconcile self-report with shipped code; add rm-l1-cv-builder roadmap\n\nREADME, agent-graph README and ARCHITECTURE_V2 now carry a dated \"As built\n(2026-09-24)\" section plus a \"Designed, not built\" table naming the slice or\nTD item that would build each missing component. ARCHITECTURE_V2''s 2025-12-04\ndesign is kept under an explicit \"not as built\" heading; its projected\nperformance and feature-parity tables are removed.\n\n.claude/roadmap.md registers delivery against l1-cv-builder: PH1 V2 hygiene +\nRAG decision, PH2 grounding floor, PH3 hosted keyless path, PH4 TD-004/005/007.\n\nRefs #154\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42f0e2bc762cea4c4b2e3252e63bb5477274ea6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/42f0e2bc762cea4c4b2e3252e63bb5477274ea6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/1f48bdab863e8ac298951387743d3a98f51e1134","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"