m","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: update stale default model to claude-opus-5\n\nREADME''s env.json example and packages/agent-core/env.json.example still\nset claude-sonnet-4-20250514. Because env.json''s `model` overrides the\nconfig default, copying the example silently pinned agents to Sonnet 4\ninstead of the claude-opus-5 default from d63a93d.\n\nOriginally proposed by daily-cleaner (2026-08-19); that edit also dropped\nthe README example''s closing brace, which is restored here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"843b5bc2553234eaa2c53c60a582c2dc1ca37939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/843b5bc2553234eaa2c53c60a582c2dc1ca37939"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/b670930ad4c582d64db2339233367a7c308cf964","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/b670930ad4c582d64db2339233367a7c308cf964","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKGI2NzA5MzBhZDRjNTgyZDY0ZGIyMzM5MjMzMzY3YTdjMzA4Y2Y5NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b","sha":"2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b"}],"sha":"b670930ad4c582d64db2339233367a7c308cf964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/b670930ad4c582d64db2339233367a7c308cf964"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:10:52Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:39:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(deps): refresh audit floors for advisories published since Aug 19\n\nThe branch''s green audit went stale: re-running `pnpm audit --prod\n--audit-level=high` on 084501a found 16 new HIGH advisories. Raises the\nsame floors this PR introduced:\n\n- @xmldom/xmldom >=0.9.12 (11 HIGH, via mammoth)\n- multer >=2.3.0 / api range ^2.3.0 (3 HIGH + 1 low)\n- sharp ^0.35.4 (GHSA-rgj7-g3m4-5g8c)\n- js-yaml@>=4.0.0 >=4.3.2 (GHSA-2883-xcg3-v3hh)\n- qs >=6.16.0 (2 moderate)\n- uuid@>=13.0.0 >=13.0.1 <14.0.0 (moderate, patch-only)\n\nAudit now: 0 high/critical, 2 moderate (accepted uuid 10.x instance).\nVerified: frozen install, type-check, build (security scan CLEAN),\napi + eslint-plugin tests, sharp 0.35.4 resize smoke test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"152f3611620be9f1c12464d3df2389ce84387b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/152f3611620be9f1c12464d3df2389ce84387b3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKDJjODMwMWEzNTEwOTNjOTY4MGE0ZjBhYzljMTliMzk1M2IzMTA4N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8","sha":"c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8"}],"sha":"2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/2c8301a351093c9680a4f0ac9c19b3953b31087b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:51:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:39:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(deps): resolve 8 HIGH prod vulns blocking the dependency audit\n\npnpm audit --prod --audit-level=high has failed on main since ~June 26,\nbreaking the Audit Dependencies job in security-scan.yml (19 advisories:\n1 low, 10 moderate, 8 high). Fixes, per package:\n\nRoot overrides (transitives, following 6a73d27/fd36078 pattern):\n- immutable >=5.1.8 (was >=5.1.5) — GHSA-v56q-mh7h-f735 + GHSA-xvcm-6775-5m9r\n  (HIGH, DoS), via @carbon/react > sass. Resolves 5.1.9.\n- ws >=8.21.0 <9 — GHSA-96hv-2xvq-fx4p (HIGH) + GHSA-58qx-3vcg-4xpx, via\n  langsmith. Resolves 8.21.3.\n- form-data >=4.0.6 <5 — GHSA-hmw2-7cc7-3qxx (HIGH, CRLF injection), via\n  @anthropic-ai/sdk > @types/node-fetch. Only 4.x exists in the tree.\n- js-yaml@>=4.0.0 -> >=4.3.1 <5 — GHSA-52cp-r559-cp3m + GHSA-5p4m-2wfm-xmqj\n  (HIGH) + GHSA-h67p-54hq-rp68. Scoped to 4.x: a js-yaml@3.14.2 also exists\n  and a blanket floor would force it across the 3->4 breaking major.\n- multer >=2.2.0 <3 — GHSA-72gw-mp4g-v24j (HIGH) + GHSA-3p4h-7m6x-2hcm.\n- qs >=6.15.2 (was >=6.14.1) — GHSA-q8mj-m7cp-5q26.\n- fast-xml-parser >=5.7.0 (was >=5.5.6) — GHSA-gh4j-gqv2-49f6.\n- body-parser >=1.20.6 <2 — GHSA-v422-hmwv-36x6 (low), patch-level.\n\nDirect deps (packages/api):\n- sharp ^0.34.5 -> ^0.35.0 — GHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj (HIGH, libvips CVEs);\n  0.35.0 is outside the old caret range. Resolves 0.35.3, type-check clean.\n- file-type -> ^21.3.4 — GHSA-5v7r-6r5c-r473 + GHSA-j47w-4g3g-c36v.\n\nAccepted (documented in overrides comment): uuid GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq\n(moderate) — one tree instance is uuid@10 and the fix requires a breaking\nmajor jump; moderate is below the CI gate.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm audit --prod --audit-level=high exits 0 (3 moderate, 0 high/critical).\n- pnpm type-check passes across all 8 workspace projects.\n- pnpm build passes (incl. security prebuild + artifact scanner: CLEAN).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7889c954dba3440619c7b09039ba0d20a0ac96e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/7889c954dba3440619c7b09039ba0d20a0ac96e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKGM2MjMyMjRmNWYyMDgxNmU4NGM4YjgzYWU2M2MwYjdhMTc2MzI2Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/c4f2beefc705037413687249d47d9f66681c3fec","sha":"c4f2beefc705037413687249d47d9f66681c3fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/c4f2beefc705037413687249d47d9f66681c3fec"}],"sha":"c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/c623224f5f20816e84c8b83ae63c0b7a176326f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/c4f2beefc705037413687249d47d9f66681c3fec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:10:06Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:14:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(browser-app): import agent-core models via subpaths, not the index\n\nThe package index''s module graph includes the agent classes and therefore\n@anthropic-ai/sdk. Value imports (BioSchema/JobListingSchema) and\nvalue-syntax type imports through the index pulled the SDK client into the\nbrowser Dashboard chunk — the artifact scanner rightly blocks that\n(ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / dangerouslyAllowBrowser strings in a shipped bundle).\nSubpath model imports keep the server SDK out of the browser graph entirely\nand shrink the bundle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81c87d1e06453e1aef215f65904dbc835b0ad4ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/81c87d1e06453e1aef215f65904dbc835b0ad4ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/c4f2beefc705037413687249d47d9f66681c3fec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.