min":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/2106be84ca3563a9dd814409d4bc1db8fe6f8316/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:02:34Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:14:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(cli): make headless generate work from any directory\n\nThree fixes for ''pnpm cli:headless -- --job <id>'':\n- the script passed --headless, which commander rejects; run the generate\n  subcommand instead\n- pnpm (unlike npm) forwards the literal -- separator into argv, and\n  commander then drops every flag after it as positional; strip bare --\n  tokens before parsing\n- config resolved directories against process.cwd(), so env.json paths like\n  personal/jobs only worked from the repo root; resolve against the\n  workspace root instead (absolute paths still win via path.resolve)\n\nconfig.ts also carries the claude-opus-5 model-default lines from the\nmigration port. Docs updated: the examples passed jobs/example.json where\n--job takes a bare job ID, and one used npm run in a pnpm repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45193a67846a039f1791b964e2b261ec97d1463d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/45193a67846a039f1791b964e2b261ec97d1463d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/2106be84ca3563a9dd814409d4bc1db8fe6f8316","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/2106be84ca3563a9dd814409d4bc1db8fe6f8316","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKDIxMDZiZTg0Y2EzNTYzYTlkZDgxNDQwOWQ0YmMxZGI4ZmU2ZjgzMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da","sha":"ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da"}],"sha":"2106be84ca3563a9dd814409d4bc1db8fe6f8316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/2106be84ca3563a9dd814409d4bc1db8fe6f8316"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:02:34Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:14:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(agent-core): inject saved bio/job data into orchestrator requests\n\nprocessRequest/processRequestStreaming never invoked the loadBio/loadJob\nhelpers, so the NL path answered ''I couldn''t find a saved listing'' even when\nthe files existed. Prepend a saved_data block: bio (or explicit ''none''), the\nindex of saved job IDs, and full JSON for any job referenced by ID in the\nrequest. Direct injection over tool-use keeps the path deterministic with no\nextra model round-trips.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"870837030c6fc62ca85c5d3c18f4d09f4ff9c782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/870837030c6fc62ca85c5d3c18f4d09f4ff9c782"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKGVlNjZhNzQyZjJmMzk1Mzk5ZGM3ZjE4MWE2ZDBlZWQwNmJhOWIzZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962","sha":"3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962"}],"sha":"ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/ee66a742f2f395399dc7f181a6d0eed06ba9b3da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:02:21Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:14:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(agent-core): structured outputs for job analysis\n\nanalyzeJob/analyzeJobWithBio crashed with ''Failed to parse job analysis\nresponse'' whenever the model wrapped its JSON in markdown. Replace the\nregex-extract + JSON.parse path with messages.parse() and an\noutput_config.format json_schema, so the response shape is enforced by the\nAPI instead of the prompt. Requires @anthropic-ai/sdk >=0.117 (zod 3.25);\nthe response schema is authored via zod/v4 (the SDK helper''s requirement)\nwhile the canonical JobAnalysisSchema still validates the final object.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2eaeccb4bc7e37097714f8ef8ffdaa79c1beb98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/a2eaeccb4bc7e37097714f8ef8ffdaa79c1beb98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKDNmYzA3ZGUzOGM3NjFlNTkzMjZkOTQwZWQ2OWYzM2IxOWZiYzI5NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/d63a93dd1274619bce7d5423f5223ca5324f1455","sha":"d63a93dd1274619bce7d5423f5223ca5324f1455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/d63a93dd1274619bce7d5423f5223ca5324f1455"}],"sha":"3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/3fc07de38c761e59326d940ed69f33b19fbc2962"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/d63a93dd1274619bce7d5423f5223ca5324f1455/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:02:11Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T03:14:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(models): default agents to claude-opus-5 with 16k max output\n\nPorts the Opus 5 migration edits (model IDs + BaseAgent max_tokens 4096->16000)\nthat were sitting uncommitted in the main checkout''s working tree. The higher\noutput ceiling leaves room for Opus 5''s default-on thinking, which shares the\nmax_tokens budget with response text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4302ecd57f54ce65f98759fc163539c25036852b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/4302ecd57f54ce65f98759fc163539c25036852b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/d63a93dd1274619bce7d5423f5223ca5324f1455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/d63a93dd1274619b