loring, and trustworthy/non-hallucinated output — both\nladdering to ns:l2-ojfbot#P1 (the fleet ships demoable surfaces).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQap7GLuiso4RG165V8LUz","tree":{"sha":"785291c1cd054bcf787dc032fa80996bb54a6b5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/785291c1cd054bcf787dc032fa80996bb54a6b5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/2a88ec18587de254af7f7ba2adf3e37bf9875029","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/2a88ec18587de254af7f7ba2adf3e37bf9875029","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKDJhODhlYzE4NTg3ZGUyNTRhZjdmN2JhMmFkZjNlMzdiZjk4NzUwMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/7ed1ef29b77502724b799d88ec7e18c43a607cb8","sha":"7ed1ef29b77502724b799d88ec7e18c43a607cb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/7ed1ef29b77502724b799d88ec7e18c43a607cb8"}],"sha":"2a88ec18587de254af7f7ba2adf3e37bf9875029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/2a88ec18587de254af7f7ba2adf3e37bf9875029"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/7ed1ef29b77502724b799d88ec7e18c43a607cb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:23:17Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:57:07Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs(claude-md): route CLAUDE.md by loading-discipline (ADR-0081)\n\nApply the ADR-0081 loading-discipline to cv-builder''s 366-line CLAUDE.md.\nAlways-loaded footprint: ~4151 -> ~941 tokens (366 -> 72 lines), ~77% drop.\nRelocate-only (0 deletes, 0 @import); all distinctive strings verified present.\n\nRouting:\n- Layer 1: packages/agent-core/CLAUDE.md (nested) <- add-an-agent procedure +\n  models note; loads when editing that package.\n- Layer 1: .claude/rules/mf-and-deploy.md (paths: browser-app + vercel.json) <-\n  Module Federation surface, shared singletons, local MF dev, Vercel deploy +\n  cache-header rules.\n- Layer 2: docs/claude-reference.md <- prerequisites, ESLint custom-rule\n  catalog, Claude Code hook wiring, security commands, env setup, data dirs,\n  architecture detail (multi-agent, monorepo tree, data models, package\n  imports), agent system + .agents/ catalog, key technologies.\n- Layer 0 (stays): identity + server-side-only invariant, pnpm, command\n  quick-ref, security/secrets invariant, testing philosophy, privacy,\n  deployment-safety invariant.\n\nFix: the broken root pointer ''see ARCHITECTURE.md'' (CLAUDE.md:15) now targets\ndocs/ARCHITECTURE.md (the real path). Verified docs/ARCHITECTURE.md is NOT a\nsuperset of the CLAUDE.md architecture block (missing Skills Gap Analyzer,\nInterview Coach, container-presenter, ResearchEntry, @frame/eslint-plugin,\nthree-tier storage) -> relocated those to Layer 2 rather than deleting.\n\nL2 lives in repo-native docs/ (domain-knowledge/ is a gitignored symlink farm).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6d82682898bc3f25607767b5d70c04361161bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/b6d82682898bc3f25607767b5d70c04361161bf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/7ed1ef29b77502724b799d88ec7e18c43a607cb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"htt