:{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:46:50Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T22:50:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(deps): resolve HIGH transitive vulns (langsmith, fast-xml-builder)\n\npnpm audit --prod --audit-level=high failed on 2 HIGH advisories in the\nLangChain stack (packages/agent-graph), blocking all PRs:\n\n- langsmith <0.6.0 (resolved 0.5.11) — GHSA-3644-q5cj-c5c7: public prompt\n  pull deserializes untrusted manifests. Override langsmith >=0.6.0 <1.0.0;\n  the upper bound keeps it within @langchain/core@1.1.38''s declared range\n  (>=0.5.0 <1.0.0). Resolves to 0.7.4.\n- fast-xml-builder <=1.1.6 — attribute-value quote-bypass; pulled via\n  @langchain/anthropic. Override >=1.1.7 <2.0.0. Resolves to 1.2.0.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm audit --prod --audit-level=high now exits 0 (8 moderate, 0 high).\n- pnpm type-check passes across all 8 workspace projects, incl. agent-graph\n  (langsmith 0.5->0.7 is type-compatible).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c222c58fa4481cce0b39239e584fc0a66f7f453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/4c222c58fa4481cce0b39239e584fc0a66f7f453"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/6a73d27314c62f8be013a32c7f08a3162cbc2385","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organization