 to @cv-builder/browser-app. The\npackage was renamed to @resume-builder/browser-app — that''s the\ncorrect filter name. The prior commit broke Vercel builds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3d2a8a2f8326713b5321f2e8ccf8cdc681a237b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/f3d2a8a2f8326713b5321f2e8ccf8cdc681a237b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/e72e12125d1cc3f2c65681768e577c5c1342ebe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/e72e12125d1cc3f2c65681768e577c5c1342ebe6","node_id":"C_kwDOQV9s8doAKGU3MmUxMjEyNWQxY2MzZjJjNjU2ODE3NjhlNTc3YzVjMTM0MmViZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/cv-builder/commit/f3fbc1f5dfa7aa5e403b8f0d3e870bd2d2ed6411","sha":"f3fbc1f5dfa7aa5e403b8f0d3e870bd2d2ed6411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/f3fbc1f5dfa7aa5e403b8f0d3e870bd2d2ed6411"}],"sha":"e72e12125d1cc3f2c65681768e577c5c1342ebe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/e72e12125d1cc3f2c65681768e577c5c1342ebe6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/f3fbc1f5dfa7aa5e403b8f0d3e870bd2d2ed6411/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T15:52:45Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T15:53:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(deploy): correct buildCommand filter — @cv-builder/browser-app\n\nThe rename commit changed the Vercel buildCommand to\n@resume-builder/browser-app but the actual package.json name is still\n@cv-builder/browser-app. pnpm --filter silently matches nothing, so\nVercel serves stale artifacts. This is the production outage root cause.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22c037482c754d8dec88d8651cd349de7d2883da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/22c037482c754d8dec88d8651cd349de7d2883da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r