https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/9b84f80c2306144bd96d59ab9f5aba0ce228a56b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T15:43:40Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T15:44:29Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(deploy): swap vercel.json header order so remoteEntry.js gets no-store\n\nVercel applies all matching header rules — later rules override earlier\nones for the same key. The wildcard /assets/(.*) was overriding the\nspecific /assets/remoteEntry.js rule, causing remoteEntry.js to be\nserved with immutable caching. After a deploy, the shell loads a stale\nmanifest pointing to old chunk hashes that no longer exist.\n\nFix: put the wildcard rule first, specific remoteEntry.js rule last.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3d2a8a2f8326713b5321f2e8ccf8cdc681a237b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/f3d2a8a2f8326713b5321f2e8ccf8cdc681a237b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/9b84f80c2306144bd96d59ab9f5aba0ce228a56b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806