ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/commits/6a160887f2bd30579eacda4e0f25db6a3469dabb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T05:23:43Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T06:36:24Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(settings): expose bare SettingsPanel via MF ./Settings for shell integration\n\nShell''s SettingsModal loads this panel via React.lazy() + Suspense. Panel is\ndisplay-only (static info about server-side API key management). AgentContext\nis not available in the shell''s MF context, so dynamic connection status is\ndeferred to a follow-up phase.\n\n- SettingsPanel.tsx: static info panel (no useAgent dependency)\n- vite.config.ts: add ''./Settings'' to federation exposes alongside ''./Dashboard''\n\nSpec: ojfbot/shell#7 (shell SettingsModal infrastructure)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf4bd46b2537cd3819bc6fee5abc3d5a5d012aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/trees/bf4bd46b2537cd3819bc6fee5abc3d5a5d012aaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/cv-builder/git/commits/6a160887f2bd30579eacda4e0f25db6a3469dabb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co