C demonstrates correct bug pattern (listener accumulation)\n- Identified critical infinite render loop issue (addLog called during render)\n- Created fixed version using useLayoutEffect for logging\n- Generated comprehensive verification report with technical analysis\n- Added README with testing instructions and summary\n\nThe fixed POC now works properly while still demonstrating the listener\naccumulation bug that caused intermittent popup failures.","tree":{"sha":"8e3f9cdc397b18d3ca38a938bea930114d3b25b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdityaP68/mfe-bug-pocs/git/trees/8e3f9cdc397b18d3ca38a938bea930114d3b25b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdityaP68/mfe-bug-pocs/git/commits/ef286148a32044eb1de265fcbc16060fc930d0db","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e3f9cdc397b18d3ca38a938bea930114d3b25b4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763201884 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763201884 +0000\n\nVerify MFE event listener POC and provide fixed version\n\n- Verified original POC demonstrates correct bug pattern (listener accumulation)\n- Identified critical infinite render loop issue (addLog called during render)\n- Created fixed version using useLayoutEffect for logging\n- Generated comprehensive verification report with technical analysis\n- Added README with testing instructions and summary\n\nThe fixed POC now works properly while still demonstrating the listener\naccumulation bug that caused intermittent popup failures.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCyidlSD\nCHbuOjQV6q1VR/hn3n21S68pOudSea87XUi5bdr2acr5usZdGNGcjzYc024qgWNpQJVZ6R1JxTW5\n8wY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-15T10:18:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy