":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/557f0f54b8b4bdc61c67423e88e558f18d945c64","node_id":"C_kwDOQWYjcNoAKDU1N2YwZjU0YjhiNGJkYzYxYzY3NDIzZTg4ZTU1OGYxOGQ5NDVjNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/dae1252261d2734c6f32ba85baf7ad06065125d0","sha":"dae1252261d2734c6f32ba85baf7ad06065125d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/dae1252261d2734c6f32ba85baf7ad06065125d0"}],"sha":"557f0f54b8b4bdc61c67423e88e558f18d945c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/557f0f54b8b4bdc61c67423e88e558f18d945c64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/dae1252261d2734c6f32ba85baf7ad06065125d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:01:19Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:01:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Filter, search and page the vocabulary concept tables (#283)\n\nThe Included concepts and Source codes tables list every concept a set\nresolves to, which is routinely thousands of rows, and offered no way to\nnarrow them. The rows-per-page control at the foot of both tables was\nvisible and focusable but inert: binding a bare :items-per-page makes\nv-data-table''s model controlled, so the user''s choice was emitted and\nthen overwritten by the unchanged literal.\n\nReuse the facet bar the concept search results and the Compare tab\nalready use rather than growing a second filtering mechanism. Each table\ngets the facets matching its own categorical columns, so no filter refers\nto something off screen, along with the substring box the bar carries.\nHand the page size to the table so the footer control takes effect, and\nenable multi-column sort.\n\nFiltering an empty result set through the existing \"no concepts\" state\nwould have claimed the set was empty, so a filtered-to-nothing table says\nso in the body and offers to clear. Source codes drop their filters when\nthe included set changes, since the new rows live in a different value\nspace.","tree":{"sha":"0478146683bf8bcfcf779579f12d00e62d7f6e26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/0478146683bf8bcfcf779579f12d00e62d7f6e26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/dae1252261d2734c6f32ba85baf7ad06065125d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 0478146683bf8bcfcf779579f12d00e62d7f6e26\nparent 3524883ba2c8145b95483ea3325ec1588c89e630\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1787493679 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787493679 +0800\n\nFilter, search and page the vocabulary concept tables (#283)\n\nThe Included concepts and Source codes tables list every concept a set\nresolves to, which is routinely thousands of rows, and offered no way to\nnarrow them. The rows-per-page control at the foot of both tables was\nvisible and focusable but inert: binding a bare :items-per-page makes\nv-data-table''s model controlled, so the user''s choice was emitted and\nthen overwritten by the unchanged literal.\n\nReuse the facet bar the concept search results and the Compare tab\nalready use rather than growing a second filtering mechanism. Each table\ngets the facets matching its own categorical columns, so no filter refers\nto something off screen, along with the substring box the bar carries.\nHand the page size to the table so the footer control takes effect, and\nenable multi-column sort.\n\nFiltering an empty result set through the existing \"no concepts\" state\nwould have claimed the set was empty, so a filtered-to-nothing table says\nso in the body and offers to clear. Source codes drop their filters when\nthe included set changes, since the new rows live in a different value\nspace.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiv0vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZy4QABmIm57ywrQ1HGbQ6AFoD9lA\ntZ2w/OJMKOIPwkj3awL5bY/EcUk1pBDaQhDwl1oXI5laLX/OSCGTV7h8MjbNszo+\nAa1GKRdC1vBMM357fm6b8G3qpWJbatVpkOHihc3QfEu7+Jd6Z//5i1zd3uza3vRv\ns5+FaIZ4R7yyK8tv9+byA4+rySugwTcSwXgjlvuh75PYimmKMb1siik4z3+od61D\nVohKXwhUHMwBRQ9iTBWLW0atAAkPddH9UdasZfSsZawUUg4lL20WjRotOSpSLd6K\nQjRcq1JWHwr3AXD/TN30/Wbco+37sYZW0n3/FLuS1MiMLbkKm5QWN4lwdddJ1Eo2\nhDcNX4AkDpgyBKmCeFg0jQNneiAlYaeLhC2bz05W2MAc70P5xmk1R59ZN0SM6PcQ\nn2GiAPeKFEK++FpGCLNRG8Ch6WMau3eAplo5/+/wavSpTai9gsHYjzMyTcXupOIA\nj6a3kjrjKAdLyvlNvjVN9Ax+lwS4vkEdluxXLbNCLFPnJN+3UJ0D7jABHdxT9J3i\nU8O0PBksqClO7KljFuL/LscPpI2qOSVowE7U/6SJDR8d3HVzo+4Q5E09EYlCbblb\ne1+levsQlBrfkD6DVIkcqj/caYWmx2AV4bBM5LH8RwAQUJ8kLdSQZP9lPK8yz1cp\nB2Zds5a6mDcnBposP3ha\n=A1f3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T14:01:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api