r":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/40f7e68be14a6c0c2d90e2d83861b53dc7fc5c62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T18:13:19Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T18:13:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Stop feature analysis presets being opened, copied or deleted (#279)\n\nThe list gated its actions on permissions alone and never looked at the\nanalysis type, so a preset opened a fully editable design form and\noffered copy and delete alongside it.\n\nGuard the handlers and pass the type through the table''s per row\npredicates. Presets now render their name as plain text and drop the\nedit action, so the row no longer invites a click that goes nowhere.","tree":{"sha":"868d10410329a20ae4113bb7cd53bb6979a0a07d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/868d10410329a20ae4113bb7cd53bb6979a0a07d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/40f7e68be14a6c0c2d90e2d83861b53dc7fc5c62","verification":{"payload":"tree 868d10410329a20ae4113bb7cd53bb6979a0a07d\nparent ce85402467a4b972e25e4e84f377e864c3ea31c6\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1787335999 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787335999 -0400\n\nStop feature analysis presets being opened, copied or deleted (#279)\n\nThe list gated its actions on permissions alone and never looked at the\nanalysis type, so a preset opened a fully editable design form and\noffered copy and delete alongside it.\n\nGuard the handlers and pass the type through the table''s per row\npredicates. Presets now render their name as plain text and drop the\nedit action, so the row no longer invites a click that goes nowhere.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiJU/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8ogQAKjsMaqynmDVYsNgVU8HSc5d\nVr0ZemVTMPuWnYkmZ2mVdPVQAl3ydwR0WQ2EMRk1cGwVN3+LAxZOy800Y4CuEwU7\nymrT/36LS0e6lf4n0DjWFQ0QHxQAA6G6gpc0DfghERg+ilFeb1wUAPCnm1KgRCRc\nC9baambQVSdaCo81vEgC8t908ez2WHOrxYpZqSmCA64bQi8k0jJmjHRXbG9M8WK5\nwTyTpw9pgVTrjxSRiLzBv94T8Er//bUs7uRxWUBgCOh2rtonM544abzf985kIKXa\nx9pHN4oOk4bcn84hVhjckx6+lb6jbPh5V1E2QPY2ScWnPYKNVtxLucY4IMZrs5HZ\ni8Vt+psukuv8MHrCIDmUPPIzYeN4njzm144ldmiPa1QVO/g2RqOBiB/mnqfJ/3cg\nGFkoFXEKGRpW7M8K/VNasZ0WapBhbOKCGw0oBv4VLQaQUxPUcgg5VFANR72x1jqR\nmAfh4pt4nvmTH2Jusvkb/zAOBY9GOy/hrOgN0ZKZyjTACi2c0pz7TwX7T4xmYL2C\nJsOE6HbcFLBpSiHU46igdrwn2g/8WIuzAzvbpX5LVEY/7FfBXmko4P4snICJNKFY\nG0HgHpjngXovNq9tsKwtQyzPv1ULv8gh6MnfH+S9g4JTHCUZ9Ecv3uNmTmhVwhHz\nDVzUdQUFhV1NW+VA6za2\n=Mf3u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-21T18:13:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu