/commits/1814e5faa47c9d29158670ff16e254095b9b1fe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T14:30:56Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T14:30:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Allow an incomplete cohort definition to be saved (#282)\n\nThe save gate required at least one entry event, while the unsaved\nchanges indicator required only a name, so naming a new cohort raised\nthe dirty marker and left Save disabled with no way to keep the work.\n\nCompleteness is not this gate''s job. Generation already refuses a design\nit cannot run, and it gates on the cohort being saved rather than on\nthis flag, so dropping the entry event term lets a draft be parked\nwithout making an unrunnable cohort generatable.","tree":{"sha":"1fece4c5dcadf9a34ef074b5afebe9409b36b413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/1fece4c5dcadf9a34ef074b5afebe9409b36b413"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/1814e5faa47c9d29158670ff16e254095b9b1fe3","verification":{"payload":"tree 1fece4c5dcadf9a34ef074b5afebe9409b36b413\nparent 77a7c15333ecfd06f5f497e713f464e6992d510e\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1787322656 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787322656 -0400\n\nAllow an incomplete cohort definition to be saved (#282)\n\nThe save gate required at least one entry event, while the unsaved\nchanges indicator required only a name, so naming a new cohort raised\nthe dirty marker and left Save disabled with no way to keep the work.\n\nCompleteness is not this gate''s job. Generation already refuses a design\nit cannot run, and it gates on the cohort being saved rather than on\nthis flag, so dropping the entry event term lets a draft be parked\nwithout making an unrunnable cohort generatable.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiGEgCRC1aQ7uu5Uhl