url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/902f157405fd9c9ff21c18423e427b83603672f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/cc2f54c1fe2b26149497a511a8f7d289df266b94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T07:46:18Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T07:46:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix renamed concept set not updating in the concept set list (#212) (#237)\n\nhandleConceptSetApplied() updated every criterion''s own event.conceptSet\ncopy unconditionally, but only wrote the change into the cohort''s\ncanonical conceptSets array (what ConceptSetsListDialog reads) when a\nselection context or pending callback was active. A pure rename via\nthe pencil icon sets neither, so the canonical array kept the old name\nwhile every criterion using that concept set already showed the new\none, until the cohort was reloaded.\n\nWrite to the canonical array unconditionally instead.","tree":{"sha":"cb719d903474e42df813fa0d1c0501b109d6b06b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/cb719d903474e42df813fa0d1c0501b109d6b06b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/cc2f54c1fe2b26149497a511a8f7d289df266b94","verification":{"payload":"tree cb719d903474e42df813fa0d1c0501b109d6b06b\nparent 35668b71f69f14c4c30780ab938df6b8fea19fae\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1786693578 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786693578 +0800\n\nFix renamed concept set not updating in the concept set list (#212) (#237)\n\nhandleConceptSetApplied() updated every criterion''s own event.conceptSet\ncopy unconditionally, but only wrote the change into the cohort''s\ncanonical conceptSets array (what ConceptSetsListDialog reads) when a\nselection context or pending callback was active. A pure rename via\nthe pencil icon sets neither, so the canonical array kept the old name\nwhile every criterion using that concept set already showed the new\none, until the cohort was reloaded.\n\nWrite to the canonical array unconditionally instead.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfsfKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADYwQADszTpHHBKKoRVGKOZXbJnnU\nwHvkNDI9DJ+dPVQg76eExSAyUIqPmMU/v/PoY01fJ7uVoAsDFAo5EuEJFL99L1tm\nQL7Zm4JDOGdzp9LriKVUNkvIsyqh9JI6/nQTp7tK/gjeAOxv7PKKIGM4OJr03Qkc\nj9kkDupNSuonSu0bZRgCRmqv2lmbtKlzaL0y+dmEQicRv2LUgaNReBQGDXeuj9wb\n55hfogTw1USPM2cnO+rEeVROjUBVm4zKZgAkUr6wVwd1+c4JwuHRmiHbsdIw43gq\njtSHsDrSPSo1X0ffvTRIodTm0HMrHlQDzrszS9BKpIR6m6pfNl0bByfd/7Gt6UKD\nkG+6SOqZ/zbznGxD9vu3paT/j4T1lnijDtIS/5/b5EtjhjlfQR9mquc0m1WHd5EH\nEaKlBAjEurlGYrbhliuYXtMGPGaBYMSxQBmsa93Knv9sXc2AIrpdyuzQd4tNtXYG\nv9ES5kIy8y6kPhh7xps9tkPNOKtRjW4pVbW+3neap6i4AznZsXVAQa8sM+Ge518e\n3TXffEAvoVsDeMd2eLoEZfuHop9JELiKBvhnfJEUu19eDo0wg/PYRizLKsvgS44A\nqmtxxdo1HJnnk5M96HV3ygNZo/CSxRnK2VZynD/mX/ix+GqI/5h3MS4QL1THmZPf\nFNUb7GlIdNncNjPHgTlY\n=xONk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","veri