as3/commits/c891e0e58bc15ffcc3af872d8022da73d268673c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/faf476c63b10d04efab29ca2e7436b5f70b1e22a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:06:02Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:06:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show which data source a cohort sample belongs to (#204) (#232)\n\nOnce inside the sample view there was no indication of which source''s\nsample was being looked at, ambiguous when a cohort has samples from\nmore than one source. The source key was already threaded through as\na prop, just never resolved to a display name or shown. Add a source\nname line to the header, resolved from the data sources store.","tree":{"sha":"7f4d3f9acdd039b90939f95ca993504a10b1b4f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/7f4d3f9acdd039b90939f95ca993504a10b1b4f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/faf476c63b10d04efab29ca2e7436b5f70b1e22a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f4d3f9acdd039b90939f95ca993504a10b1b4f6\nparent 9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1786687562 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786687562 +0800\n\nShow which data source a cohort sample belongs to (#204) (#232)\n\nOnce inside the sample view there was no indication of which source''s\nsample was being looked at, ambiguous when a cohort has samples from\nmore than one source. The source key was already threaded through as\na prop, just never resolved to a display name or shown. Add a source\nname line to the header, resolved from the data sources store.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfrBKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl6UQAK1c88g3npqcG0eVBe92Rfb4\nUVLw/12X3d9+FPhl1Up3XmLyLqno1Jrqh6k+UIEGe8WjjHBgsyAR22oECUsdDFSX\nTVn9EsibDFi3/gglfRvMYe9lRZC+gTHMjWi0kaNr3OwRQHc/oZyyOtZJQwTxJuSp\noESwRA0FcxXGdy+17Q6uYY970nGpoEi2j91dJPl9ZJxjNv0ndOuf/h6hGVIQvKM6\naf9lrFMZwTi1I7JgAhaLBPzKqcCnFnCl28C2Jki5YWLD6XI/eAtXC5hRh5U9cUA2\nlACLnE4t53xvvsiPaM9XmxX/lA3oT+tw+gYLrkS/iSymu4crBG5WUBwezprfk7SQ\nmJnv+1rL6sGgtXz/qRik7yGflq9S27eHCap7m9aobJr46UQdR12CJiaV3/x+ifzj\n5xfHMf+tXM9tdaQfirAsMcOeqs/8Kr6YeSfjvNehXSY2vD4hQoLspSWGFmKCuWof\nHq+/6gQ5hFwqmUT04KfLQWQjvMVRs30Qd4vmW7YR/+8A1x6Vfk52YiMTJgE0bRld\nKnLAblnFGR+wYHmjBM3YPL46/ArQPQWuxmMojMSEjWfJJGJEEBEzAkeoToIsaaHh\n/IUidNfU7gPy0V+sYvJfSjyiKENvKrqSp7afxXBkNLStzyNqH4jMWQ4uwP9PfOjB\nR5gcFECqSvL05hIJf4vI\n=q6CJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T06:06:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/faf476c63b10d04efab29ca2e7436b5f70b1e22a","node_id":"C_kwDOQWYjcNoAKGZhZjQ3NmM2M2IxMGQwNGVmYWIyOWNhMmU3NDM2YjVmNzBiMWUyMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c","sha":"9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c"}],"sha":"faf476c63b10d04efab29ca2e7436b5f70b1e22a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/faf476c63b10d04efab29ca2e7436b5f70b1e22a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T05:54:38Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T05:54:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix concept search silently showing zero results on page 2 (#201) (#229)\n\nThe concept-search store''s ''concepts'' getter already sliced results to\nthe current page, then handed that page-sized array to AtlasDataTable\ntogether with the same page/itemsPerPage props, which sliced it a\nsecond time. Page 1 looked fine by coincidence; page 2 sliced an\nout-of-range window from an already-page-sized array and silently\nreturned nothing.\n\nStop pre-slicing in the store and let the table do pagination once,\nthe same pattern already used by RecommendTab. Also tighten the\nconcept-search e2e assertion that should have caught this: it accepted\nzero rows on page 2 as passing.\n\nNote: #203 (related-concepts page 2) reports the same symptom on a\ndifferent component that does not pre-slice its data, so it is likely\na separate cause and is not fixed by this change.","tree":{"sha":"86648966302a990dde85ecfd455b119f820fc422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/86648966302a990dde85ecfd455b119f820fc422"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c","verification":{"payload":"tree 86648966302a990dde85ecfd455b119f820fc422\nparent e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1786686878 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786686878 +0000\n\nFix concept search silently showing zero results on page 2 (#201) (#229)\n\nThe concept-search store''s ''concepts'' getter already sliced results to\nthe current page, then handed that page-sized array to AtlasDataTable\ntogether with the same page/itemsPerPage props, which sliced it a\nsecond time. Page 1 looked fine by coincidence; page 2 sliced an\nout-of-range window from an already-page-sized array and silently\nreturned nothing.\n\nStop pre-slicing in the store and let the table do pagination once,\nthe same pattern already used by RecommendTab. Also tighten the\nconcept-search e2e assertion that should have caught this: it accepted\nzero rows on page 2 as passing.\n\nNote: #203 (related-concepts page 2) reports the same symptom on a\ndifferent component that does not pre-slice its data, so it is likely\na separate cause and is not fixed by this change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfq2eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJY4QAGWtGBbBK0gPG3rqc9SPesZq\n5lTgZdseZGIUJXBers7MtIWqPmRmi+gaqbdidFbS/qo37A3r2qEmmrHdKXdl8xeC\nv8jcuw7G0221CJpoK6BFmI7sTyg6Lr0WCgzaFbGbRPow1api+5syN5UJy74viNGF\n6+55yk4wZNBGtuE4qLahquUruIZjH/AHhdw44EQ00pxwBH5r5tfQFc8C/as9AC7D\nwYeh1sMdINi6Cw/IceyNgDDfT7VsHjda/F5IZIjS3ayz+lgbHMpPXt8YavdwgjQa\nAX4jJgNwfz6/PrguE3QcojLWnOZhOJEIfCEhCfa921C0G11VXRHkwfyUqQ8BDrCx\nC1gj7p7vUqLOb4j/0CcPpBrwcroY4Jd8GUGhiwJSUpdcjKtTAH2NpeS/YSGIkFy+\nMVs1eOK99OTi7BNLEYOw3yMuOvQz//Ir+m9gc1Ea8OO7KWLcld4ggF33ZsGq8m0A\n+MvjjwHqKpGnCRkv5msWaFobov9bo1TeZ8Kl2wz5VnMXi4crMmRhr366u8yiVKQx\nTDG7iI8oX42tXA6Ty/KvQ5vURgUJ4Y0MJWwcIJwRG/larmXRy4UhTSiNEJGpi/3r\nxywQvUkSp9nxoZKWA+6qnNFRo01bQjNdRy2maEHzAApID+c2EJn9Wd8EZWpzsBrK\npq8XCxcA7SLehPFg5bGR\n=ldI+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T05:54:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c","node_id":"C_kwDOQWYjcNoAKDlmNjE5ODQ4ZDg4NDY4N2M2N2ZiZjkxMGY3Njk5ODNmYzY3YjE2NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002","sha":"e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002"}],"sha":"9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/9f619848d884687c67fbf910f769983fc67b164c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T05:53:59Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T05:53:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix table pagination getting stuck when a caller does not manage it (#203, #222) (#231)\n\nAtlasDataTable always bound an explicit page/items-per-page prop onto\nthe underlying v-data-table, with numeric defaults, even for callers\nthat never pass those props themselves and never listen for the\nupdate events. Vuetify decides a data table''s pagination is externally\ncontrolled purely from whether those prop keys are present at all, so\nv-data-table''s own internal pager got permanently frozen at whatever\nliteral/default value AtlasDataTable''s caller happened to pass,\nregardless of clicks in the footer.\n\nOnly forward page/items-per-page to v-data-table when the caller\nactually provided them, so callers that don''t manage pagination\nthemselves get normal, working, uncontrolled pagination instead.","tree":{"sha":"fdd52e86cc758275e10a4e11f7d11a661ea76f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/fdd52e86cc758275e10a4e11f7d11a661ea76f70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002","verification":{"payload":"tree fdd52e86cc758275e10a4e11f7d11a661ea76f70\nparent 7f999d1eafb27ebf3f01caf020ab44d5844f6682\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1786686839 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786686839 +0800\n\nFix table pagination getting stuck when a caller does not manage it (#203, #222) (#231)\n\nAtlasDataTable always bound an explicit page/items-per-page prop onto\nthe underlying v-data-table, with numeric defaults, even for callers\nthat never pass those props themselves and never listen for the\nupdate events. Vuetify decides a data table''s pagination is externally\ncontrolled purely from whether those prop keys are present at all, so\nv-data-table''s own internal pager got permanently frozen at whatever\nliteral/default value AtlasDataTable''s caller happened to pass,\nregardless of clicks in the footer.\n\nOnly forward page/items-per-page to v-data-table when the caller\nactually provided them, so callers that don''t manage pagination\nthemselves get normal, working, uncontrolled pagination instead.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfq13CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJGQQAA+inDcMau4YVi1GaD4NAC4K\n0lt1+DLY1JNiQqIDmD5mxjAI6tFjui2or4f87W0/dxG3etv96h3GBozyxAiScSVi\nRZf5SCDxAevlSykbq+PM7O+vgOn7b/r6l1GYzlfi4D2WmQkXnjouFoCmfeW8LdD+\n+dXDCo2UNqohug1fRxdBYeCOunB9gZjO3gvLMRksJAm3sRt1PwJeSLxZZIAPkNTG\n7q4RQM80gREdImF3HWeB9HI1KaUWWpOucXzs31c7VXyh4w9ghkq3sFvjvH5q1TE0\n8MI/ehmwux0XgkZzbD0KHmeqDj2Ml4HTk6TJLP5UG9nlEBh+BfK8gElg9hkyoWWS\nV8v8FX1giA+K7sORdvOUSpPe3Bq0mm3lIqh/kjOc7MG++Y69hTJbLtQqR0LZoKgv\nNHfEW6a2/pt1Tr3X+vBTrF8MCnld1yw35DV4RKs4IszdS6Xn5nFh7QTYElk63VNs\n/2vpRZXfiw/DYFIdbbIHegxiwrlkqpRqT/rHyO91qagD97SoKAAwLVrlkLBPPobl\n295redg9CUim1bWYYs0E8deWyFSNytY6K7LzhvhEXFNG9yNvBG4IW4iF8b/K1txm\nAc0uAAKoWwoaePRxqv8bgOiFi7v0WXsZxDtlVDaeiCtSxPM9AgZE2VLEeImQ9Jer\nxhBIID9cluoKpXE8pcC8\n=rPl0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T05:54:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002","node_id":"C_kwDOQWYjcNoAKGUyYzJiYzU5ZTUzOTNjZWI3NjAxZDY5ZGYwMTcyOWY2ZjdhZDQwMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OHDSI/Atlas3/commit/7f999d1eafb27ebf3f01caf020ab44d5844f6682","sha":"7f999d1eafb27ebf3f01caf020ab44d5844f6682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/7f999d1eafb27ebf3f01caf020ab44d5844f6682"}],"sha":"e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/e2c2bc59e5393ceb7601d69df01729f6f7ad4002"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p-hoffmann","id":954078,"login":"p-hoffmann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDA3OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-hoffmann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/commits/7f999d1eafb27ebf3f01caf020ab44d5844f6682/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T05:52:02Z","email":"954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter Hoffmann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T05:52:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix inclusion rules report showing empty despite valid data (#202) (#230)\n\nThe InclusionRuleReportSchema required treemapData as a plain string,\nbut the server omits it when there is nothing to plot (small cohort,\nor mode=0/by-event). safeParse then failed validation for the whole\nenvelope and getInclusionRuleReport returned null, discarding a\nperfectly valid summary and inclusionRuleStats and rendering as an\nindistinguishable ''no report data'' state. The existing optional\nchaining on treemapData when decoding it already assumed this could\nhappen; the schema just didn''t allow it.\n\nMake treemapData nullable/optional.","tree":{"sha":"a68c7f1d2681a9cc23d61cc4066b49c6fec208e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/trees/a68c7f1d2681a9cc23d61cc4066b49c6fec208e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OHDSI/Atlas3/git/commits/7f999d1eafb27ebf3f01caf020ab44d5844f6682","verification":{"payload":"tree a68c7f1d2681a9cc23d61cc4066b49c6fec208e6\nparent 7cd77617fb581aae339f362cc0e6424043542ba0\nauthor Peter Hoffmann <954078+p-hoffmann@users.noreply.github.com> 1786686722 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786686722 +0800\n\nFix inclusion rules report showing empty despite valid data (#202) (#230)\n\nThe InclusionRuleReportSchema required treemapData as a plain string,\nbut the server omits it when there is nothing to plot (small cohort,\nor mode=0/by-event). safeParse then failed validation for the whole\nenvelope and getInclusionRuleReport returned null, discarding a\nperfectly valid summary and inclusionRuleStats and rendering as an\nindistinguishable ''no report data'' state. The existing optional\nchaining on treemapData when decoding it already assumed this could\nhappen; the schema just didn''t allow it.\n\nMake treemapData nullable/optional.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfq0CCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlvgQAH2lJLO6N6G2utnMAqjMRA4T\nN3VbWlw1SpfTpGOEMIQc91MKdy/bbANK/eqYZx80JZRwN8NbjZmoMKkF4P0N+VTu\nRNTOYUuH/G422/INXZf7WAa3yty969aEfhR/KOV95haTIxA6e0QZ54in23qmy26Z\n7w0JVl9WVyKgigoattn/GxB5zSVDcNd3xOXBQoa4iSB72uVL0YEwl0UyoQ0xKWsg\nWP3UTd7Ye4OtS0VtmSWM9cqNfhgl6BfpGxP6sNP4MPOkYzOUv+zICSJRESN3YR5K\n+KbZuJw+WZ+BiNtomTEYhrTW3pRwi5xwSzBAlTDROhVi4OzksDQyLQoWQokefqIX\nyuY0KwQzLpB9l+2ZxIWS1AEAzOU750nslj0YXxDwdwp0NN9GLQMq6OCq0uoIuHNE\neud38SVwtHmHwU7YWTxElDVOnnzdBLt2N2Yca20eFA0S8bH591Og+Rea8CQRIQjc\nt9Pv4/QM6L4WQ6x0WL6VTrV77ZIn6tjADGstRtaiDCGQ8ntdjHS4cdz0MpiA4pCP\nQCcjZ22RInOKXtt2nLfqfQ5PL0cPLyuyxiufMNk1jb9GJ6eYJiOYVv64hItQwEdo\nZsqYbKCkvIa+DI19DXGWBdLyKkGNTZ6xpAf5JJKX4m2hKO+U+y22XAulbzwvA0gN\nFdqWpTKBZ/XebidYZVcx\n=UkVU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T05:52:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscripti