:{"date":"2025-11-23T16:04:50Z","email":"david040431@gmail.com","name":"Min Jae David Park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-23T16:04:50Z","email":"david040431@gmail.com","name":"Min Jae David Park"},"message":"fix: optimize Manim rendering to prevent OOM crashes on Railway\n\nMemory Optimizations:\n- Reduced resolution from 720p to 480p (854x480)\n- Lowered frame rate from 30fps to 24fps\n- Added Manim memory-saving config options\n- Disabled preview, save_last_frame, and write_all\n\nError Handling:\n- Added specific detection for exit code -9 (OOM kill)\n- Display user-friendly error message for memory issues\n- Updated video path detection to check 480p24 folder\n\nAI Prompt Updates:\n- Added MEMORY CONSTRAINTS section to prompt\n- Instruct AI to keep visualizations simple (max 20-30 objects)\n- Focus on key steps for complex problems, not every detail\n- Reuse objects instead of creating new ones\n\nThis should fix the issue where complex problems fail with exit code -9\nin deployment (Railway) while working fine locally.","tree":{"sha":"0dcaa4eff0650d52839a004117c1abd41b604a5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/git/trees/0dcaa4eff0650d52839a004117c1abd41b604a5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/git/commits/af88ea3662ed74d44d2d5a7000cf001babdc1119","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73091156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minjaedavidpark","id":73091156,"login":"minjaedavidpark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDkxMTU2","organizations_url":"https://