ode files to temp/ dir to prevent service restarts\n- Added comprehensive documentation in AI_VISUALIZATION.md\n- Updated .gitignore to exclude temp files and logs\n\nTechnical Improvements:\n- Dynamic scene generator properly handles import statements\n- Restricted builtins allows classes while blocking dangerous ops\n- Safety checks prevent file I/O, subprocess, introspection\n- Video rendering tested for simple and complex visualizations\n\nTesting:\n- Simple text visualization working\n- Complex TSP visualization working\n- API endpoints responding correctly\n- Safety checks preventing unsafe code\n\nThe system can now generate visualizations for ANY mathematical\nor algorithmic problem using AI-generated Manim code.","tree":{"sha":"ef206edd5384fcba12cc432685396cc9088d0a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/git/trees/ef206edd5384fcba12cc432685396cc9088d0a85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/git/commits/a1ba2eb8ab1f84ea65e2992bd386c33b7d121f7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73091156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minjaedavidpark","id":73091156,"login":"minjaedavidpark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDkxMTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap