D/commits/29f24cfc5c8b083510a7962e9b2e4647f61e7e83"}],"sha":"072f467797b193c4fe7e2ac2b68fa8c50bc3e0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/commits/072f467797b193c4fe7e2ac2b68fa8c50bc3e0b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73091156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minjaedavidpark","id":73091156,"login":"minjaedavidpark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDkxMTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/commits/29f24cfc5c8b083510a7962e9b2e4647f61e7e83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T01:03:50Z","email":"david040431@gmail.com","name":"Min Jae David Park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T01:03:50Z","email":"david040431@gmail.com","name":"Min Jae David Park"},"message":"feat: add OpenAI support and Manim visualization integration\n\nThis commit adds two major features to ReasoningGym:\n\n1. OpenAI API Support\n   - Add OpenAI client with streaming support (src/lib/openaiClient.ts)\n   - Create unified LLM client that supports both Anthropic and OpenAI (src/lib/llmClient.ts)\n   - Update all API routes (coach, critique, planner) to use unified client\n   - Add LLM_PROVIDER and OPENAI_API_KEY environment variables\n   - Update documentation with OpenAI setup instructions\n\n2. Manim Visualization Integration\n   - Add Manim service for generating mathematical visualizations (manim-service/)\n   - Implement Flask API server for handling visualization requests\n   - Create scene generator with support for equations, graphs, geometry, and more\n   - Add visualization panel component for the coach interface\n   - Use LLM to intelligently extract visualization parameters from problems\n   - Add comprehensive logging for debugging\n   - Include setup documentation (MANIM_QUICKSTART.md, LATEX_FIX.md)\n\nTechnical details:\n- Manim service runs on port 5001\n- Videos generated in 720p30 format\n- Requires LaTeX with additional packages (standalone, preview, dvisvgm)\n- Full CORS support for browser integration\n- Automatic visualization type detection using LLM\n\nThe visualization feature is optional and the app works fine without it.","tree":{"sha":"9f9549981210985fd93aae4398360e26668af7bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/git/trees/9f9549981210985fd93aae4398360e26668af7bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/minjaedavidpark/QED/git/commits/29f24cfc5c8b083510a7962e9b2e4647f61e7e83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73091156?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/minjaedavidpark","id":73091156,"login":"minjaedavidpark","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDkxMTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/minjaedavidpark/orgs","received_events_url":"htt