mport-core.\n\nPreviously:\n- API used nanoid() for cards, assets, versions\n- Web used crypto.randomUUID() for the same\n- This caused inconsistent ID formats in the database\n\nNow all internal IDs use UUID format, which is important for federation\ncompatibility where IDs appear in sync URLs and cross-platform references.\n\nChanges:\n- Add generateId() utility with HTTP fallback for non-secure contexts\n- Update 8 API files to use generateId() instead of nanoid()\n- Update 12 web files to use generateId() instead of crypto.randomUUID()\n- RAG store keeps nanoid(10/12) for short internal document IDs\n- Voxta spec UUIDs remain handled by @character-foundry/voxta\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c9f9dc416662b8d0debd31f0b1da8a260dbff10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/character-foundry/character-architect/git/trees/5c9f9dc416662b8d0debd31f0b1da8a260dbff10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/character-foundry/character-architect/git/commits/45a124eacaaf0086f0788e40559ca10b4e0c5e5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231548431?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/axAilotl","id":231548431,"login":"axAilotl","node_id":"U_kgDODc0mDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axAilotl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su